    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Non-automatic electromechanical vehicle mounted weighing instrument. Design as vehicle mounted weighing instrument without lever system; the force is introduced into four load cells. Also available as multi-interval or multiple range weighing instrument. The weighing ranges with Max, Min, verification scale interval and number of verification scale intervals may be selected taking into account the limiting values in Table 1 and No. 3.2 of the associated Report in accordance with Nos. 2 and 3 of R76-1. Due to the modular construction, the fractions of the error limit p_i of the individual modules must comply with: 1 >= p_i1^2 + p_i2^2 + ... + p_in^2 (No. 3.5.4 of R76-1)."
